	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"最強の戦士、超サイヤ人４孫悟空がパッケージをリニューアルして登場！！",
			"• 大猿のパワーを宿した究極の肉体を、マッスルビルドシステムにより構築せよ！",
			"• 特徴的な赤い体毛や目の周りのふちどりもパーツ成形色で忠実に再現！",
			"• 表情パーツは「通常」と「怒り」が付属！",
			"• ひじ関節に引き出し構造を、腰パーツに左右に大きくスイングできる構造を採用し、驚異の可動域を実現！腰パーツの交換なしにフュージョンのポーズを実現。「Figure-rise Standard 超サイヤ人４ベジータ」（別売り）と組み合わせてフュージョンを決めよう！",
			"• 全高約180mm。"
		],
		"en": [
			"The strongest warrior, Super Saiyan 4 Son Goku, has been released with a renewed package! !",
			"• Build the ultimate body with the power of a great ape using the muscle build system!",
			"• The characteristic red body hair and edges around the eyes are also faithfully reproduced with parts molding colors!",
			"• \"Normal\" and \"angry\" expression parts are included!",
			"• The elbow joint has a drawer structure and the waist part has a structure that allows it to swing left and right, allowing for an amazing range of motion! Achieve fusion poses without replacing waist parts. Create a fusion by combining it with \"Figure-rise Standard Super Saiyan 4 Vegeta\" (sold separately)!",
			"• Overall height approximately 180mm."
		]
	},
